This package implements the requested EIT-to-VMC proof-of-concept experiments.
The position decoder and Amodo ARIA serial reader follow the local
eit_position_toolkit/contact_position.py and eit_reader.py training and acquisition
algorithms. They are included locally so no original-workspace path is required
at deployment.
The source reference inspected for Franka conventions was the user's
Transformer/VMC_Transformer_Research_Brief/hardware/franka_transformer_cutting
package. Its controller is not a runtime dependency. This package uses direct
libfranka executables inside ROS 2, rather than loading the reference ROS-control
plugin. libfranka and ROS 2 retain their respective licenses.
models/position_model.npz is copied from the measured
2026-10-24_11-41-56_JST_d87beb16_david_hydrogel_works session. Its acquisition
settings and trained vectors are retained in the checkpoint. No physical robot
trial has been performed with this package.
